WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
This guide uses the recovery phrase method.
Keep your recovery phrase private.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Visit phantom.com/download.
Choose iOS or Android and install the official app.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Tap More Options.
We are using the recovery phrase option.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Tap Create Recovery Phrase.
Button wording may vary with your app version.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Write all 12 words in the correct order.
Never share them or use a screenshot as your backup.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Tap OK, I Saved It and follow the confirmation.
Phantom cannot recover a lost recovery phrase.

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Choose a username, then continue.
Enable Face ID or fingerprint where available.

8
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Tap Deposit, then Receive Crypto.
Some versions show a Receive button instead.

9
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Choose Receive Crypto.
You do not need to buy anything to copy an address.

10
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Choose Solana for MVXA.
Use the main wallet address, not the Cash account.

11
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Share your public Solana address to receive tokens.
The example on screen is not a payment address.

12
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:25.000
MILVEXA never needs your recovery phrase or private key.
Only share your public Solana wallet address.

13
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Learn about the MILVEXA Charge pilot at milvexa.xyz.
Independent guide. Not affiliated with Phantom.
